REFERENCE           DISMEMBER1
LANG_ENGLISH        "Minimal"
LANG_SPANISH        "Mínimo"

REFERENCE           DISMEMBER1_DESC
LANG_ENGLISH        "Only hands and feet get cut off often, corpses disappear after death."
LANG_SPANISH        "Sólo se cortan a menudo manos y pies; los cadáveres desaparecen tras la muerte."

REFERENCE           DISMEMBER2
LANG_ENGLISH        "Moderate"
LANG_SPANISH        "Moderado"

REFERENCE           DISMEMBER2_DESC
LANG_ENGLISH        "Hands, feet, arms, legs get cut off often, corpses stick around longer."
LANG_SPANISH        "Se cortan a menudo manos, pies, brazos y piernas; los cadáveres permanecen más tiempo."

REFERENCE           DISMEMBER3
LANG_ENGLISH        "Realistic"
LANG_SPANISH        "Realista"

REFERENCE           DISMEMBER3_DESC
LANG_ENGLISH        "Hands, feet, arms, legs, heads, and torsos get cut off very often. Corpses can be dismembered and never disappear."
LANG_SPANISH        "Se cortan muy a menudo manos, pies, brazos, piernas, cabezas y torsos. Los cadáveres pueden despedazarse y nunca desaparecen."

